.TH SDL_RESTRICT 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_RESTRICT \- A macro to tag a pointer variable, to help with pointer aliasing.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_begin_code.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_RESTRICT __restrict
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A good explanation of the restrict keyword is here:
.PP
https://en\[char46]wikipedia\[char46]org/wiki/Restrict
.PP
On compilers without restrict support, this is defined to nothing\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This macro is available since SDL 3\[char46]4\[char46]0\[char46]

